Kill {c_number}25{/c} {c_important}Elites{/c} across {c_important}Nightmare Dungeons{/c} to reveal a {c_important}Horadric Altar{/c}. Activating it results in one of the following outcomes:

{icon:bullet,1.2}Summon {c_important}Elites{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2}Summon {c_important}Treasure Goblins{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2}Summon {c_important}The Butcher{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2}Gain {c_important}Riches{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2}{c_important}Terrible Misfortune{/c}
